WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
- We're almost at the end of the show

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.790
but I can't close out before
sharing one last story

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.500
to bring you joy and laughter.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.893
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.893 --> 00:00:09.940
(upbeat music)
(audience cheers)

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.340
Let's be honest, no one
likes a wedding crasher,

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.929
unless you're the one crashing it.

00:00:13.929 --> 00:00:17.610
That's just part of what is
amazing about this TikTok post.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.503
Just look.

00:00:18.503 --> 00:00:21.053
- [Angie] A bear showed
up at my cousin's wedding.

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:25.150
(metal clangs)

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.733
(wedding guests murmur)

00:00:30.712 --> 00:00:32.870
(audience cheers)

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:34.279
- What the hell?

00:00:34.279 --> 00:00:36.656
They're acting like a dog

00:00:36.656 --> 00:00:37.489
(audience laughs)

00:00:37.489 --> 00:00:38.322
just came.

00:00:38.322 --> 00:00:40.530
Like, I know black bears don't
attack you like grizzlies,

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.225
but, like, it's not a dog

00:00:42.225 --> 00:00:43.058
(audience laughs)

00:00:43.058 --> 00:00:43.891
and all these people are just

00:00:43.891 --> 00:00:45.560
like, "Yeah, I'm just eating my," what?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.590
We have the woman who captured that moment

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:50.030
joining us now say "hi"
to Angie who watches

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:51.970
on NBC7 San Diego at 2:00pm.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.450
(audience cheers)

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:57.540
So, Angie, first of all, rad
choice of color for your hair.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:02.540
Secondly, no one seemed
phased by an actual bear

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.580
just hanging out at the wedding.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.930
Is that normal at weddings you go to?

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:10.200
- Well, hi, Kelly.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.520
So yeah, this happened
in my cousin's wedding

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:17.430
down in Mexico, in a national
park, called Chipinque.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.300
There was a hotel there, it's beautiful.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.130
There's a forest, there's mountains,

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:24.168
and the staff told us to be in the lookout

00:01:24.168 --> 00:01:27.610
for some bears and more
animals, mostly the black bear.

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:30.770
So over there, just at the
reception, you know, normal,

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:33.700
we were eating some
appetizers when these bear

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:35.330
just crashes the wedding.

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:37.962
And, you know, we were all very mesmerized

00:01:37.962 --> 00:01:40.170
and very surprised about this,

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:43.520
but the staff, who very quickly
and told us not to move,

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.160
they were banging chairs on the floor

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:49.660
so it would make a sound, so
the bear will, like, you know,

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:51.670
get scared and go away.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.830
But, like, the funniest
part is, like, you know,

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:56.150
my family took it a
little bit too literally

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:56.983
when they told us, like,

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:59.190
"Oh, just pretend like
it's nothing there."

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:01.670
So, yeah, the staff
made us feel very safe.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:03.000
- You are
(audience claps)

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.120
from a family of warriors
is all I'm saying, Angie.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:07.810
That was an awesome video, I loved it.

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:08.643
Thank you for sharing.

00:02:08.643 --> 00:02:10.307
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:10.307 --> 00:02:11.140
(bell dings)

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.102
- [Angie] Thank you so much.

00:02:12.102 --> 00:02:13.160
- Look at the paws, it's amazing.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.305
He's, like, "Oh, can I have this steak?"

00:02:15.305 --> 00:02:16.138
(Kelly chuckles)

00:02:16.138 --> 00:02:16.971
He's like.

00:02:16.971 --> 00:02:18.222
That's not all, though.

00:02:18.222 --> 00:02:19.260
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:21.450
makers of Frixion, the go-to erasable pen

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.490
of "The Kelly Clarkson
Show" thinks that your video

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:25.480
is unbelievably awesome as we do,

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:27.210
so they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.493
just 'cause it's awesome.

00:02:28.493 --> 00:02:29.909
(audience cheers)

00:02:29.909 --> 00:02:32.214
(Kelly claps)

00:02:32.214 --> 00:02:33.340
- Thank you, so much.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.090
- [Kelly] Have fun with that money.

